fragment_downloaded_cb({"url":"gst-rtsp-server/rtsp-client.html#GstRTSPClient::pre-closed","fragment":"\n\tpre-closed\n\n\n\tpre-closed\n\n\n\tpre-closed\n\nProvide a way for an application to be notified when a connection is closed,\nbefore the client's sessions are cleaned up.\nParameters:\n\n\tFlags:\t\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\tRun Last\n\t\t\t\n\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.28\n\t\t\nProvide a way for an application to be notified when a connection is closed,\nbefore the client's sessions are cleaned up.\nParameters:\n\n\tFlags:\t\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\tRun Last\n\t\t\t\n\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.28\n\t\t\nProvide a way for an application to be notified when a connection is closed,\nbefore the client's sessions are cleaned up.\nParameters:\n\n\tFlags:\t\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\tRun Last\n\t\t\t\n\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.28\n\t\t\n"});